### Получить все документы
GET http://localhost:8080/api/masters

### Создать новый документ
POST http://localhost:8080/api/masters
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "number" : 105,
    "date" : "2026-11-06",
    "note" : "Test document"
}

### Проверка валидации
POST http://localhost:8080/api/masters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": 999,
  "date": "2026-11-07",
  "note": "Test delete"
}

### Обновить документ
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/masters/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": 110,
  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "note": "Updated  document with same number"
}

### Удаление
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/masters/5/details/5

### Создать спецификацию
POST http://localhost:8080/api/masters/5/details
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "totalDet": 1500
}

### Обновить спецификацию
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/masters/4/details/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name" : "Monitor Samsung",
  "totalDet" : 20000
}